  "goodToKnow": "Das Dreieck is a triangle: ein rechtwinkliges Dreieck (right-angled triangle). Every German car must carry a Warndreieck (warning triangle) to set up behind a breakdown. Das Autobahndreieck is a motorway junction where one motorway ends in another, and das Dreiländereck is a point where three countries meet, like near Basel. Eine Dreiecksbeziehung is a love triangle. From drei (three) and die Ecke (corner). Plural: die Dreiecke."
